						"description": "Public endpoint (no auth) to submit a doctor application. Must be sent as multipart/form-data:\n- `data` (text): JSON string matching `{ user: { name, email }, doctor: { address?, specialization, licenseNumber, qualifications, experienceYears, bio?, consultationFee?, contactNumber? } }`\n- `resume` (file, max 1): CV/resume document\n- `additionalFiles` (file, up to 10): certificates/licenses\n\nOn success an OTP is emailed to the doctor's address \u2014 verify it with 'Verify Doctor Email' before an admin can approve it.",
